      "start_seconds": 0.66,
      "end_seconds": 3.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "good afternoon, how are you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.55,
      "end_seconds": 7.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Morning, doctor, sorry about the rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 8.25,
      "end_seconds": 13.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "good morning, um, doctor i came along to help out"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.89,
      "end_seconds": 15.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "where shall we begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 17.22,
      "end_seconds": 22.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.68,
      "text": "Doctor, it's swollen ankles in the evening. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.61,
      "end_seconds": 32.67,
      "duration_seconds": 9.06,
      "text": "can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.89,
      "end_seconds": 41.48,
      "duration_seconds": 7.59,
      "text": "Mostly severe. It's worse with standing all day. It sort of comes and goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.64,
      "end_seconds": 45.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.13,
      "end_seconds": 77.17,
      "duration_seconds": 30.04,
      "text": "It usually comes with a flushed face sometimes. And tight shoes by the end of the day, too. With tight shoes by the end of the day, it sort of comes and goes. The flushed face sometimes? That's been since Monday. With flushed face sometimes, maybe a eight out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.54,
      "end_seconds": 83.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "What about a bit of a headache, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.55,
      "end_seconds": 92.81,
      "duration_seconds": 8.26,
      "text": "Yes, for two days. About bit of a headache, pretty mild, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.9,
      "end_seconds": 103.55,
      "duration_seconds": 8.65,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any calf pain, one leg more swollen than the other or breathlessness lying flat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.31,
      "end_seconds": 113.53,
      "duration_seconds": 9.22,
      "text": "I haven't had calf pain, one leg more swollen than the other or breathlessness lying flat, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.85,
      "end_seconds": 123.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "have you noticed weight gain or reduced urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.98,
      "end_seconds": 128.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "No weight gain or reduced urine, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.96,
      "end_seconds": 137.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.68,
      "end_seconds": 140.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.67,
      "end_seconds": 144.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "what about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.48,
      "end_seconds": 152.51,
      "duration_seconds": 7.03,
      "text": "High blood pressure, for five years. I've had low haemoglobin for five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.21,
      "end_seconds": 162.67,
      "duration_seconds": 8.46,
      "text": "Alright, low haemoglobin, that matches what I have here. Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.56,
      "end_seconds": 169.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.27,
      "text": "I'm on iron tablets, once a day for my blood count"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.67,
      "end_seconds": 176.17,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.2,
      "end_seconds": 195.82,
      "duration_seconds": 18.62,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal. I smoke roughly a pack every two days. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.91,
      "end_seconds": 210.27,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.88,
      "end_seconds": 214.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "no, not at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.84,
      "end_seconds": 230.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.87,
      "end_seconds": 245.58,
      "duration_seconds": 13.71,
      "text": "Hmm, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic. But I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 246.76,
      "end_seconds": 256.1,
      "duration_seconds": 9.34,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Pressure 162 over 101, oxygen saturation is 99 percent, temperature 37.0, pulse is 82 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.71,
      "end_seconds": 258.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "Good, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.58,
      "end_seconds": 263.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Now I'm gonna do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 265.26,
      "end_seconds": 266.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 274.18,
      "end_seconds": 278.28,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Chest is clear and the neck veins aren't raised."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.04,
      "end_seconds": 281.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "Nearly finished here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.7,
      "end_seconds": 295.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "Mild pitting swelling around both ankles, equal on both sides."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.92,
      "end_seconds": 315.62,
      "duration_seconds": 15.7,
      "text": "Okay, please sit back down. Okay, thinking it through, I think we're dealing with ankle swelling possibly from a blood pressure tablet at this stage. It could also be a venous problem, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.79,
      "end_seconds": 332.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Have you had any tests for this so far?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.22,
      "end_seconds": 342.66,
      "duration_seconds": 8.44,
      "text": "I had kidney function tests done at another clinic last month. I don't have the report with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.2,
      "end_seconds": 370.71,
      "duration_seconds": 26.51,
      "text": "I'll request a urine protein test, it'll help with leg swelling. I'll request an echocardiogram, it'll help with leg swelling. Raise your legs when you're sitting and try compression socks. Do get help quickly if the symptoms get worse. I'll want another look after the results are back. Can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 372.79,
      "end_seconds": 378.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.62,
      "text": "So, I come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 380.42,
      "end_seconds": 385.9,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 391.4,
      "end_seconds": 395.93,
